    "chunk_text": "ewur\u00f0an mihte, \u00ferowian martyrdom mid \u00feam apostolum, and gewende \u00fea Hit gelamp \u00f0a swa, for his langsumum f\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea halgan apostolas, swa swa se h\u00e6lend wolde, He com \u00fea \u00e6t nextan si\u00f0\u00f0an se casere Nero his lif geendode earmlicum dea\u00f0e, and w\u00e6s Clemens papa \u00dea wunode se bisceop binnan Rome byrig mid Clemente papan cu\u00f0lice sume hwile, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Clemens Far nu on Godes naman to Francena rice, swa swa Cristes cempa, mid cenum geleafan, and beo \u00fee Ic cwe\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu underfo eall Francena rice to \u00feinre bodunge, and beo Crist sylf mid \u00f0e, swa hwider Ne wanda \u00feu nateshwon for \u00fean w\u00e6lhreowan folce; swa man swi\u00f0or swinc\u00f0, swa man selran mede He funde him \u00fea geferan, and he ferde gebyld \u00feurh \u00feone halgan gast, \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enum bodigende He gebohte \u00fea land \u00e6t anum geleaffullan men, and \u00fe\u00e6r cyrcan ar\u00e6rde hra\u00f0e mid cr\u00e6fte and Godes Hw\u00e6t \u00fea Dionisius d\u00e6ghwamlice gebigde fela to geleafan mid his f\u00e6geran lare, and his Drihtne Swa fela wundra worhte se ealwealdenda God \u00feurh \u00feone halgan wer, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea wundra gebigdon \u00fea He sende his geferan sume to Ispaniam, and to o\u00f0rum landum, Godes lare to sawenne, and he sylf Gelome \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0engildan, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r heteloste w\u00e6ron, gesamnodon heora gegadan and ceaste astyrodon, Ac swa hra\u00f0e swa hi gesawon his scinendan neb",
